# Frontend

- Poll frozen REST only. Do not invent API fields. No SSE.
- Prefer five-way `latest.label` on `GET /stations?ids=` for marker color (do not N+1 151 stations). Weather is amber, never rose.
- Five-page light console: Network, Station, Alerts, Control, Guide.
- Live faults go through `POST /demo/inject` (`neighborhood`, not `cluster`). Do not call `inject.py` from Streamlit.
- Raw observed series stay visible; imputed/predicted is an overlay. Station filter is a view set; ingest still includes buddies.

See `docs/frontend.md` and `docs/contracts.md`.
